  "aiContextParagraph": "The 49th ASEAN Summit held in Manila served as a significant gathering point for international figures to discuss regional stability and cooperation. The event, which drew leaders from across the globe, featured a mix of high-level diplomatic sessions and formal social events, including a gala dinner. Among the notable interactions, Donald Trump publicly acknowledged Prabowo Subianto during the ASEAN-US summit segment. Separately, Narendra Modi engaged in diplomatic exchanges by presenting traditional Indian artworks to several heads of state, including a golden painting for the US president and a Kashmiri silk rug for the Philippine president. Other leaders, such as Anwar Ibrahim, emphasized the importance of maintaining ASEAN centrality throughout the proceedings. This summit, which saw participants from various nations arriving throughout the week, concluded with commitments to continued dialogue and strengthening diplomatic ties across the Indo-Pacific region.",
